{# roomhive/host/edit_profile.html.twig
   Host › Edit Profile — 1:1 port of legacy host/hosteditprofile.php.

   Host dashboard shell (extends host/base.html.twig; sidebar
   Settings › "Profile & Account" highlights via
   active_nav = 'editprofile' — the sidebar link to
   /host/profile/edit was pre-reserved by the shell).

   Content (1:1 with legacy):
   - "Edit Profile" header + subtitle
   - up-alert success banner ("Your profile has been updated.")
     and up-alert error list, rendered INLINE above the card on
     POST (legacy re-renders the page — no PRG, no rh_flash)
   - Account Details card: avatar (84px) with camera upload
     (img state OR first-ever icon→img swap), Full Name, locked
     Email (disabled + support hint), Phone, Age (18..120),
     Location; SAVE CHANGES + Cancel (→ /host/profile)
   - hep_csrf hidden field; the controller keeps the token in
     the session under 'hep_csrf' (legacy hep_csrf_* helpers
     were self-contained — host_init does not load functions.php)

   AVATAR UPLOAD ENDPOINT: legacy fetched
   /webprogg/user/uploadavatar.php — ONE endpoint shared by
   every shell (hosteditprofile.php, hostprofile.php, user
   editprofile.php). Its port already exists:
     POST /profile/avatar   route app_profile_avatar
     (ProfileController::uploadAvatar)
   so this page's JS posts there. Response contract of the
   PORT (differs from legacy JSON, JS below matches it):
     200 {ok: true,  url:  "/uploads/avatars/..."}
     4xx {ok: false, error: "..."}
     401 {ok: false, error: "Not logged in"}  → JS redirects to
         the login page (legacy redirected on {login: true}).
   (The /host/profile/avatar URL in HostProfileController's
   docblock was a TODO, never a route — no duplicate endpoint
   is created here.)

   ICON SUBSTITUTIONS — macro keys (admin/_macros.html.twig):
     legacy `circle-check`      → 'check-circle'
     legacy `circle-x`          → 'x-circle'
     legacy `circle-user-round` → 'circle-user-round' (direct)
     legacy `user`              → 'user-round'
     legacy `cake`              → 'calendar-days'
     legacy `map-pin`           → 'pin'
     legacy `save`              → 'check'
   Direct keys: mail, phone, camera.

   Pairs with: HostEditProfileController
     GET|POST /host/profile/edit   name app_host_edit_profile
#}
{% extends 'host/base.html.twig' %}
{% import 'admin/_macros.html.twig' as ui %}

{% set active_nav = 'editprofile' %}

{% block page_title %}Edit Profile — RoomHive{% endblock %}

{% block styles %}
<style>
    /* ---- Page header (same values as the other host pages) ---- */
    .hp-page-header {
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .hp-page-title { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--rh-ink); }
    .hp-page-subtitle { margin: 4px 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: var(--rh-muted); max-width: 680px; }

    /* =========================================================
       Edit Profile page (hep-*, exact legacy values)
    ========================================================= */
    .hep-form {
        max-width: 640px;
    }

    .hep-field {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .hep-field label {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #1c2a38;
    }

    .hep-field label svg {
        width: 14px;
        height: 14px;
        color: #b07708;
    }

    .hep-field input {
        width: 100%;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        padding: 12px 14px;
        border: 1px solid #d9dee4;
        border-radius: 10px;
        font-family: inherit;
        font-size: 13.5px;
        color: #1c2a38;
        outline: none;
        transition: border-color .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
    }

    .hep-field input:focus {
        border-color: #eda423;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.15);
    }

    .hep-field input:disabled {
        background: #f5f5f5;
        color: #999;
        cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    .hep-field-hint {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 4px;
        font-size: 11px;
        color: #8B93A6;
    }

    /* ---- Avatar + camera ---- */
    .hep-avatar-wrap {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .hep-avatar {
        position: relative;
        width: 84px;
        height: 84px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .hep-avatar img {
        width: 84px;
        height: 84px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        object-fit: cover;
        border: 2px solid #FFE3B3;
        background: #F6F4EE;
        display: block;
    }

    /* Legacy rendered <i data-lucide="circle-user-round"
       class="hep-avatar-icon"> — lucide swapped it for an 84px
       padded svg. The port renders a span with the same box and
       the inline macro svg filling it (identical 44px glyph). */
    .hep-avatar-icon {
        width: 84px;
        height: 84px;
        padding: 18px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #1c2a38;
        border: 2px solid #FFE3B3;
        color: #f6c04e;
        display: block;
    }

    .hep-avatar-icon svg {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        display: block;
    }

    .hep-photo-edit {
        position: absolute;
        right: -2px;
        bottom: -2px;
        z-index: 2;

        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
        padding: 0;

        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;

        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.15);
        border-radius: 50%;

        color: #b07708;
        cursor: pointer;

        box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);

        transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
    }

    .hep-photo-edit:hover {
        background: #FDF1DC;
        transform: scale(1.08);
    }

    .hep-photo-edit:disabled {
        opacity: 0.6;
        cursor: wait;
    }

    .hep-photo-edit svg {
        width: 15px;
        height: 15px;
    }

    .hep-avatar-copy {
        font-size: 11.5px;
        color: #8B93A6;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* ---- Actions ---- */
    .hep-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        align-items: center;
        margin-top: 24px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.08);
    }

    /* ---- Lucide base + alert icon sizing (same as legacy) ---- */
    svg.lucide {
        display: inline-block;
        vertical-align: -0.18em;
        flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .up-alert svg {
        width: 16px;
        height: 16px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        vertical-align: -3px;
        margin-right: 6px;
    }

    .hp-btn-primary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 6px;
    }

    .hp-btn-primary svg {
        width: 15px;
        height: 15px;
    }

    /* ---- Reveal (same declarations as host/profile.html.twig) ---- */
    .hp-reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); transition: opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease; transition-delay: calc(var(--i, 0) * 80ms); }
    .hp-reveal.in-view { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        .hp-reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; }
        .hep-photo-edit { transition: none; }
    }

    /* ---- Dark mode (page-local hep-* elements; hp-card comes
            from the shell) ---- */
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hp-page-title { color: #e8ecf1; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hep-field label { color: #e8ecf1; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hep-field input { background: #141b24; border-color: #1a222b; color: #e8ecf1; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hep-field input:focus { border-color: #eda423; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.12); }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hep-field input:disabled { background: #1a222b; color: #6b7684; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hep-field-hint { color: #8d99a5; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hep-avatar img { background: #1a222b; border-color: rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.35); }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hep-avatar-icon { background: #0d1218; border-color: rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.35); }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hep-photo-edit { background: #141b24; border-color: #1a222b; color: #f6c04e; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hep-photo-edit:hover { background: rgba(237, 164, 35, 0.15); }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hep-avatar-copy { color: #8d99a5; }
    body[data-theme="dark"] .hep-actions { border-top-color: #1a222b; }
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<div class="hp-page-header">
    <div>
        <h1 class="hp-page-title">Edit Profile</h1>
        <p class="hp-page-subtitle">Update your account details — hosts and support use this to reach you.</p>
    </div>
</div>

{% if saved %}
    <section class="up-alert up-alert-success" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
        <p>{{ ui.icon('check-circle') }} Your profile has been updated.</p>
    </section>
{% endif %}

{% if errors|length > 0 %}
    <section class="up-alert up-alert-error" style="margin-bottom:18px;">
        {% for error in errors %}
            <p>{{ ui.icon('x-circle') }}{{ error }}</p>
        {% endfor %}
    </section>
{% endif %}

<section class="hp-card hp-spotlight hp-reveal">

    <div class="hp-card-header">
        <h3>Account Details</h3>
    </div>

    <form method="POST" action="{{ path('app_host_edit_profile') }}" class="hep-form">
        <input type="hidden" name="hep_csrf" value="{{ csrf_token }}">

        <!-- AVATAR + CAMERA -->
        <div class="hep-avatar-wrap">
            <div class="hep-avatar">
                {% if has_real_avatar %}
                    <img src="{{ host_data.avatar }}" alt="{{ host_data.name }}" id="hepAvatarImg">
                {% else %}
                    <span class="hep-avatar-icon" id="hepAvatarImgWrap" aria-hidden="true">{{ ui.icon('circle-user-round') }}</span>
                {% endif %}

                <button
                    type="button"
                    class="hep-photo-edit"
                    id="hepPhotoButton"
                    aria-label="Change profile photo"
                    title="Change profile photo">
                    {{ ui.icon('camera') }}
                </button>

                <input
                    type="file"
                    id="hepAvatarFileInput"
                    accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"
                    style="display:none">
            </div>

            <p class="hep-avatar-copy">
                Your photo appears on your listings and messages.<br>
                JPG, PNG, or WEBP &middot; max 5MB.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- FULL NAME -->
        <div class="hep-field">
            <label for="hepName">
                {{ ui.icon('user-round') }} Full Name
            </label>
            <input type="text" id="hepName" name="name"
                value="{{ host_data.name }}" required>
        </div>

        <!-- EMAIL (locked) -->
        <div class="hep-field">
            <label for="hepEmail">
                {{ ui.icon('mail') }} Email Address
            </label>
            <input type="email" id="hepEmail" value="{{ host_data.email }}" disabled>
            <span class="hep-field-hint">Contact support to change the email on your account.</span>
        </div>

        <!-- PHONE -->
        <div class="hep-field">
            <label for="hepPhone">
                {{ ui.icon('phone') }} Phone Number
            </label>
            <input type="tel" id="hepPhone" name="phone"
                value="{{ host_data.phone }}"
                placeholder="09XX XXX XXXX" required>
        </div>

        <!-- AGE -->
        <div class="hep-field">
            <label for="hepAge">
                {{ ui.icon('calendar-days') }} Age
            </label>
            <input type="number" id="hepAge" name="age"
                value="{{ host_data.age }}"
                min="18" max="120" required>
        </div>

        <!-- LOCATION -->
        <div class="hep-field">
            <label for="hepLocation">
                {{ ui.icon('pin') }} Location
            </label>
            <input type="text" id="hepLocation" name="location"
                value="{{ host_data.location }}"
                placeholder="City, Province" required>
        </div>

        <div class="hep-actions">
            <button type="submit" class="hp-btn-primary" style="border:none; border-radius:10px; padding:12px 28px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f6b93b,#eda423); color:#1c2a38;">
                {{ ui.icon('check') }} SAVE CHANGES
            </button>
            <a href="/host/profile" class="hp-btn-outline" style="text-decoration:none; padding:12px 22px;">Cancel</a>
        </div>
    </form>
</section>

{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}
<script>
    (function () {
        "use strict";

        /* ---- Reveal ---- */
        var reduced = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;
        var revealEls = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(".hp-reveal"));
        if (reduced || !("IntersectionObserver" in window)) {
            revealEls.forEach(function (el) {
                el.classList.add("in-view");
            });
        } else {
            var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
                entries.forEach(function (entry) {
                    if (!entry.isIntersecting) return;
                    var el = entry.target;
                    io.unobserve(el);
                    el.classList.add("in-view");
                    window.setTimeout(function () {
                        el.style.setProperty("--i", "0");
                    }, 1200);
                });
            }, {
                threshold: 0.12,
                rootMargin: "0px 0px -40px 0px"
            });
            revealEls.forEach(function (el) {
                io.observe(el);
            });
        }

        /* =====================================================
           AVATAR CAMERA — uploads to app_profile_avatar
           (POST /profile/avatar — the port of legacy
           uploadavatar.php, which was ONE endpoint shared by
           every shell; no separate /host/profile/avatar route).

           Handles both states: <img> (has photo) and the
           temporary icon (no photo — first-ever upload swaps
           the icon for the returned image, and a failed upload
           swaps it back).

           Port note: the icon fallback is an inline-SVG span
           (not a lucide <i>), so the revert path re-inserts the
           stashed markup instead of calling lucide.createIcons().
          ===================================================== */
        var photoButton = document.getElementById('hepPhotoButton');
        var fileInput = document.getElementById('hepAvatarFileInput');
        var avatarImg = document.getElementById('hepAvatarImg');
        var iconWrap = document.getElementById('hepAvatarImgWrap');
        var iconMarkup = iconWrap ? iconWrap.outerHTML : null;
        var navAvatarImg = document.getElementById('navAccountAvatarImg');

        if (photoButton && fileInput) {

            photoButton.addEventListener('click', function () {
                fileInput.click();
            });

            fileInput.addEventListener('change', function () {
                var file = fileInput.files && fileInput.files[0];
                if (!file) return;

                var allowedTypes = ['image/jpeg', 'image/png', 'image/webp'];
                if (allowedTypes.indexOf(file.type) === -1) {
                    window.alert('Please choose a JPG, PNG, or WEBP image.');
                    fileInput.value = '';
                    return;
                }

                if (file.size > 5 * 1024 * 1024) {
                    window.alert('That image is too large. Please choose one under 5MB.');
                    fileInput.value = '';
                    return;
                }

                var previewUrl = URL.createObjectURL(file);
                var prevImgSrc = avatarImg ? avatarImg.src : null;
                var wasIcon = !avatarImg || avatarImg.tagName !== 'IMG';

                photoButton.disabled = true;

                /* If we were showing the temporary icon, build an
                   <img> in its place so the preview can show */
                if (wasIcon) {
                    var img = document.createElement('img');
                    img.id = 'hepAvatarImg';
                    img.alt = 'Profile photo';
                    img.src = previewUrl;
                    iconWrap.parentNode.replaceChild(img, iconWrap);
                    avatarImg = img;
                } else {
                    avatarImg.src = previewUrl;
                }

                if (navAvatarImg) navAvatarImg.src = previewUrl;

                var formData = new FormData();
                formData.append('avatar', file);

                fetch('{{ path("app_profile_avatar") }}', {
                        method: 'POST',
                        body: formData,
                        credentials: 'same-origin'
                    })
                    .then(function (res) {
                        if (res.status === 401) {
                            window.location.href = '{{ path("app_login") }}';
                            return null;
                        }
                        return res.json();
                    })
                    .then(function (data) {
                        if (data === null) return;
                        if (data && data.ok && data.url) {
                            avatarImg.src = data.url;
                            if (navAvatarImg) navAvatarImg.src = data.url;
                        } else {
                            /* revert — back to icon if it was one */
                            if (wasIcon && iconMarkup) {
                                var newImg = document.getElementById('hepAvatarImg');
                                var tmp = document.createElement('span');
                                tmp.innerHTML = iconMarkup;
                                newImg.parentNode.replaceChild(tmp.firstChild, newImg);
                                avatarImg = null;
                            } else if (avatarImg && prevImgSrc) {
                                avatarImg.src = prevImgSrc;
                            }
                            if (navAvatarImg && prevImgSrc) navAvatarImg.src = prevImgSrc;
                            window.alert((data && data.error) || 'Could not update your profile photo.');
                        }
                    })
                    .catch(function () {
                        if (wasIcon && iconMarkup) {
                            var failedImg = document.getElementById('hepAvatarImg');
                            if (failedImg) {
                                var restore = document.createElement('span');
                                restore.innerHTML = iconMarkup;
                                failedImg.parentNode.replaceChild(restore.firstChild, failedImg);
                                avatarImg = null;
                            }
                        } else if (avatarImg && prevImgSrc) {
                            avatarImg.src = prevImgSrc;
                        }
                        window.alert('Something went wrong uploading your photo. Please try again.');
                    })
                    .then(function () {
                        URL.revokeObjectURL(previewUrl);
                        photoButton.disabled = false;
                        fileInput.value = '';
                    });
            });
        }
    })();
</script>
{% endblock %}
